  "blackpast-taharqa": {"t":"Taharqa (BlackPast; search excerpt): the Twenty-fifth Dynasty ruled Egypt from 744 to 656 BCE; the Assyrians forced Taharqa and the Kushites back to Napata by 656","s":"BlackPast.org","d":"14/11/2026","u":"https://blackpast.org/global-african-history/taharqa-664-b-c-e/"},
