  "britannica-isandlwana": {"t":"Battles of Isandlwana and Rorke's Drift (Britannica; search excerpt): 22 to 23 January 1879; a Zulu force of more than 20,000 destroyed the British column at Isandlwana; the Zulu were defeated at Ulundi on 4 July 1879; Cetshwayo was captured in August","s":"Encyclopaedia Britannica","d":"14/11/2026","u":"https://www.britannica.com/event/Battles-of-Isandlwana-and-Rorkes-Drift"},
