     "x": "In 1939 medical budgets were two shillings a head in the Gold Coast and five pence in Nigeria. {{gha-vii-ch18}} Nigeria in the 1930s had twelve modern hospitals for its 4,000 Europeans and fifty-two for 40 million Africans. {{rod-colonial}}"
