     "t": "p",
     "x": "The Rwandan Patriotic Front, formed by exiles in Uganda, invaded in 1990. {{hrw-rwanda}} The attack on Kigali on the night of 04/10/1990 was staged, and about 13,000 people were arrested. {{hrw-rwanda}}"
